# Renders docs/demo/learn.gif. Run from the repo root: vhs docs/demo/learn.tape
Output docs/demo/learn.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 920
Set Height 480
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 20

Hide
Type "clear && bash docs/demo/learn-demo.sh"
Enter
Show

Sleep 11s
